    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "コホン。そういえば、資料を持参していたのだった。\nそろそろ取り出すとしよう……。む！？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_f:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "大変です、都築さん！\nわたしのカバンから、覚えのない大量のお札が！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_f:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "すごいね、麗さん。\nそんなにたくさんの紙束を持ち歩いていたの？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_f:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "レッスンのおかげで、\nずいぶん力持ちになったんだね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_f:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_07_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_07_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（あれ……思っていた反応と違う）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_07_f:step-14:text",
